    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-deut24">
        <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e98">Caput 24</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_1@1-2">Si acceperit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name> in Deut., tom. II.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e114"><seg type="qs"><pb ed="#P" n="0479C"/> Homo uxorem accepit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">tanquam indigna et errore polluta abominabilis permansit; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e121" source="http://scta.info/resource/act13_46@7-14">Vobis oportebat primum loqui verbum Dei, sed quoniam,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(Act. XIII.)</note>--></seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e127">
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e129" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_1@1-2"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e131"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e132" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, lib. I de sermone Domini in monte.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e136"><seg type="qs">Multae erant in lege causae dimittendi uxores</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut qui habent uxores, sint quasi non habentes <!--<note>(I Cor. VII)</note>-->.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_1@18-18">Scribet.</quote>
            Ad duritiam cordis vestri scripsit Moyses praeceptum istud, malens scilicet indulgere dissidium, quam committi homicidium.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e153">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e155">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e157">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e159" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_4@18-19">Ne peccare.</quote>
            Polluit terram suam, qui concupiscentiis carnalibus inquinat corpus suum. Ideo necesse est ambitionem praesentis vitae citius domari, ne valeat dominari. Et cum terrena actio semel <pb ed="#P" n="0479D"/> fuerit repulsa, non est repetenda: ne post tergum respiciat, qui in aratro manum posuerat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e166">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e168">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e170">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e172" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_5@1-2">Cum acceperit.</quote>
            Quasi, quicunque carnalibus desideriis se obligat ad regimen Ecclesiae, et ad spiritalem militiam se non habilem esse cognoscat: Quia <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e175" source="http://scta.info/resource/IItim2_4@1-12">nemo militans Deo implicat se saecularibus negotiis, ut ei placeat cui se probavit</quote>; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e178">Nemini cito manum imposueris.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e181">
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e183" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_5@1-2"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e185"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e186" ref="#IsidoreOfSeville">ISID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e189">Tollit molam superiorem qui peccatum flenti dicit: Non habebis veniam de commissis. Tollit inferiorem qui peccatum palpando dicit: Age mala quantum vis, Deus pius est et ad veniam paratus; utiliter utraque mola habetur, si spes sit cum emendante formidine, et formido cum spe.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e193">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e195">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e197">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0480A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e201" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_6@1-5">Non accipies loco pignoris inferiorem,</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e204"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e205" ref="#GregoryGreat">GREG.</name>, lib. XXXIII Moral., cap. 16.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e209"><seg type="qs">etc. Accipere aliquando offerre dicimus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et incassum metuit qui non confidit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e219">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e221">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e223">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e225" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_7@18-18">Auferes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e228"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e229" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 39.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e233"><seg type="qs">Assidue hoc Scriptura dicit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quod exponens ait: <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e239" source="http://scta.info/resource/eph4_28@1-5">Qui furabatur jam non furetur</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e247">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_8@6-7">Plagam leprae.</quote>
            Nota propter peccatum hanc infirmitatem hominibus accidere, sicut Oziae qui sacerdotium usurpavit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e256">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e258">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e260">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e262" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_10@1-2">Cum repetes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e265"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e266" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 41.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e270"><seg type="qs">Ad opus misericordiae pertinet ut pignorator in domum non intret</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">non habens ubi dormiat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e278">
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e280" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_10@1-2"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e282" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor9_14@6-10">Nonne. Qui Evangelium annuntiat, de Evangelio vivat</quote>. <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e285" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc10_7@13-18">Dignus est enim operarius mercede <pb ed="#P" n="0480B"/> sua</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e292">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e294">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e296">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e298" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_16@1-2">Non occidentur.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e301"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e302" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 42</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e306"><seg type="qs">Etiam lex dicit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">non tres vel quatuor intelligi voluit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e315">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e317">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e319">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e321" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_17@1-2">Non pervertes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-deut24-Rd1e324"><name xml:id="gom-deut24-Nd1e325" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 43</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e329"><seg type="qs">LXX: <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e332">Non declinabis judicium advenae et orphani et viduae. Non pignorabis vestimentum viduae.</quote> Cur non ait</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">continentia in eis laudatur, non desolatio commendatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e339">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e341" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_17@11-11">Viduae.</quote>
            Vidua anima ante diabolo juncta, cui conversae fidei vestimentum non est auferendum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e346">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e348">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e350">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e352" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_19@11-12">Non reverteris.</quote>
            Invidendo gentibus, qui sunt advenae testamentorum Dei.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e358">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e360">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e362">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e364" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_20@1-2">Si fruges collegeris.</quote>
            Etsi superbi colligant et improbi, ille misericordiam facit qui hoc <pb ed="#P" n="0480C"/> animo dimittit, ut egentes habeant. Praeterea cum haec populo praecipiuntur; qui non indigent, admonentur ne ista quaerant. Si autem quaesierunt, tanquam praedones pauperum judicandi sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-deut24-Dd1e371">
          <head xml:id="gom-deut24-Hd1e373">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-deut24-d1e375">
            <quote xml:id="gom-deut24-Qd1e377" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut24_21@3-4">Vineam tuam.</quote>
            Vineam de qua colligitur vinum, quod laetificat cor hominis <!--<note>(Psal. CIII)</note>-->.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
